From d83db5af68947066a9f6f968695f37ffb8a74b16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 10:49:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] docs: README regroups How we run it per model, explains
 default-on switches, names the MTP sidecar source

How we run it: one block per model (model + format first, base flags once, then what each mode adds). A line explains that default-on changes need no flag (their =0 switch only turns them off). The Flash-Next MTP sidecars are stated as ours: the MTP block of Qwen's BF16 checkpoint converted to Q8_0, and the 40K draft vocabulary variant (Strata design, re-implemented).

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release documentation for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents only; no code path is touched.
---
 README.md | 71 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 1 file changed, 52 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b2577bbab1..11fccf3726 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -51,25 +51,58 @@ after a ~12-token and a ~600-token prompt.
 
